==Portuguese==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|pt|ML.|crīdō|t=to cry out, publish, proclaim}} (compare {{cog|es|gritar}}, {{cog|ca|cridar}}, {{cog|fr|crier}}, {{cog|it|gridare}}), of uncertain origin. Perhaps from {{inh|pt|la|quirītō|t=to shriek, wail}} (per Diez), or from {{der|pt|frk|*krītan|t=to cry out, scream, proclaim}} (per Littré), compare {{cog|dum|crītan|t=to cry}}.

